  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1156/586/create_stuff_title_final-png.png\" width=\"1673\" height=\"592\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">《Create Stuff 'N Additions》是一款利用《Create（機械動力）》資源的模組，提供一套全新的裝備、工具與小發明！這些裝備不僅能提升你的身體能力（如力量或挖掘速度），還能賦予你新的移動方式，例如漂浮、彈跳甚至飛行！根據你的裝備類型（黃銅、安山岩或銅），你需要使用不同的燃料，例如蒸汽（使用水和燃料）、熱能（使用燃料）或液壓能（使用水）！此外，本模組還新增了許多配方，讓某些 Minecraft 物品（如鎖鏈盔甲、珊瑚、地獄岩、哭泣黑曜石與岩浆膏等）可以透過 Create 新增的方式（如旋轉研磨與填裝）進行製作！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>&nbsp;本模組最初是為法國 Minecraft 伺服器「Mechanical Life」所開發。</strong>此模組使用 Hybrid Mcreator 製作。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ueNNUy6enNE?si=wx5D5bbB-RDCxuIL\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LAP-V3GiwYM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pKb8vEXkRW8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>預計功能&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>-手動無人機（安山岩無人機）</p>\n<p>-可程式化無人機（黃銅無人機）</p>\n<p>-載具創意模式選單</p>\n<p>-潛水艇</p>\n<p>-小型機車&nbsp;</p>\n<p>-設定檔</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你可以將《Create Stuff Additions》放入你的整合包中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>舊版描述（v2.0.0 之前）：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>⛽ 為物品補充燃料：將該物品放在副手（選中時按 F 鍵切換即可），然後在主手放置燃料（煤炭、木頭等），最後按下 Q 鍵丟下燃料。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>全新工具：</strong></p>\n<p><br>噴嘴風扇（推動實體，可用來偏轉箭矢）、烈焰噴火器（噴射火焰）、黃銅手持鑽頭（多功能工具，挖掘速度極快但無法附魔）以及抓鉤攪拌器（僅限 1.18.2）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/632/image_2026-06-28_190551996-png.png\" width=\"1357\" height=\"483\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pvgL6kiceII?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><br><strong>《Create》舊版/新版工具：</strong></p>\n<p><br>銅製工具、鋅製工具與黃銅工具<br>烈焰工具：會熔毀你破壞的方塊（石頭：平滑石頭、花崗岩：輝長岩、原木：木炭等），攻擊生物時也會將其燒傷。（需使用攪拌機合成）<br>鍍金石英工具：效率高於鑽石，攻擊力較弱但攻擊速度極快。（需使用機械製造台合成）<br>暗影鋼工具（1.18.2 版本稱為經驗工具）：採掘等級與鐵相同，但挖掘速度比黃金更快。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/633/image_2026-06-28_190603107-png.png\" width=\"1037\" height=\"362\"><br><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>黃銅噴射背包與黃銅外骨骼：<br></strong></span><br>噴射背包可讓你飛行。黃銅外骨骼是一種盔甲，能提供力量或急迫效果。（需使用機械製造台合成）<br>它們需要燃料來充能（將燃料放在副手，然後像丟棄木炭、烈焰棒或木頭一樣按下 Q 鍵丟下即可補充）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/634/image_2026-06-28_190613334-png.png\" width=\"2334\" height=\"1700\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">銅製、鋅製、黃銅盔甲與黃銅小型機車：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/635/image_2026-06-28_190631737-png.png\" width=\"2040\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>其他內容：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/636/image_2026-06-28_190648706-png.png\" width=\"1153\" height=\"336\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你也可以看看我的其他模組：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/items-to-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/674/64/64/638476410476119618.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/depth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/720/638184653709126308.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1002/886/64/64/638523299285638581.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/779/326/64/64/638124003553252444.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/109/sons_of_sins_logo_bis.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-confectionery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/246/64/64/637852985411120756.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/608/519/64/64/637987931627550518.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-logistics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1116/69/64/64/638670333200272317.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-weight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/734/378/64/64/638084439152506136.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/774/64/64/638476553282271633.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ninjaxxs-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/549/392/64/64/637886561525247638.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fuzes-relics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/580/980/64/64/637945482784615684.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chained-to-your-friends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1387/269/256/256/638899446157903400.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jawas-lightsaber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1877/284/256/256/639176009777204482.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
